E\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]],\"$L10\"]}]\n11:T4c9,<h1>Touch of Oud, City Center Al Zahia - Luxury LED Display Installation</h1><p>Touch of Oud, a premium Arabic fragrance brand, needed a striking LED display installation for their new boutique at City Center Al Zahia, Sharjah. The dis</p><p>Touch of Oud, a premium Arabic fragrance brand, needed a striking LED display installation for their new boutique at City Center Al Zahia, Sharjah. The display had to convey luxury, draw shoppers from the mall corridor, and showcase the brand's heritage and product range in a visually captivating format that matched the store's opulent interior design.</p><p>Brightluxx designed and installed a curved LED display feature wall at the storefront entrance, creating an immersive visual gateway that showcases Touch of Oud's brand story, product range, and seasonal campaigns in ultra-high-definition. The display's curved form factor follows the store's architectural lines, while the fine-pitch LED technology ensures flawless visual quality at the close viewing distances typical in mall environments. A secondary in-store LED accent screen above the cash counter displays product information and loyalty programme promotions.</p><p>Location: City Center Al Zahia, Sharjah, UAE</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"wid